    - target: {fileID: 899811820591855403, guid: 0b62242a110afa34499a4d135aa6d7e5, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "That\u2019s Correct!\n\nRotating the circle doesn\u2019t create a new
        arrangement.\n\nWith A fixed, the two valid arrangements are ABC and ACB.\n\nThis
        can be represented with the formula of P = (n-1)!\n\nWe are subtracting to
        1 to fix an item and find the arrangments of the rest of the items."
